+-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+-- The two geometry columns, declared against whichever spatial types this
+-- database has (finding N4; see the header of 0001_extensions.sql).
+--
+--   with PostGIS   : geometry(MultiPolygon, 4326) / geometry(Point, 4326)
+--   without PostGIS: the built-in polygon / point, with 0001's ST_* fallback
